# The data build's input lists (issue #95), transcribed from the 1999
# makefile.gfx: the same names, the same order, and the same spellings as
# its command lines.  The tools see exactly the arguments make gave them.
# parkgrab sorts its sprites by path and names frames after them, and
# sprites.rsp is one of the outputs.  NTFS ignores the case, and Ninja stats
# inputs through it, so `graphics/` here finds `Graphics/`.

